    "q-343799": {
      "dom_id": "step-q343799",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Consider the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+2y=f(x),\\,y(4)=3\n$$\n\nwhere $f(x)$ is a $4$-periodic function. Fill in the missing part in the solution of the IVP, where the infinite sum on the right-hand side below represents a particular solution ${y}_{p}$ of the differential equation.\n\n*Hint: In this specific problem, the forcing function $f(x)$ is chosen such that the particular solution ${y}_{p}$ satisfies ${y}_{p}(4)=0.$*\n\nThe solution is \n\n$y(x)∼$   \n{{field-1}} \n$+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({a}_{n}cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi n}{2}x)+{b}_{n}sin\\,(\\frac{\\pi n}{2}x))$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that the general solution of a linear differential equation of the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=f(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\ny={y}_{c}+{y}_{p},\n$$\n\nwhere ${y}_{c}$ is the general solution of the corresponding homogeneous equation, and ${y}_{p}$ is a particular solution.\n\nFirst, we find the homogeneous solution. The general solution of ${y}^{′}+2y=0$ is \n\n$$\n{y}_{c}=A{e}^{-2x},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$ is an arbitrary constant.\n\nNext, we identify the form of the general solution. Because the operator ${y}^{′}+2y$ involves a first derivative, a periodic forcing function $f(x)$ results in a particular solution containing both sine and cosine terms:\n\n$$\ny(x)∼A{e}^{-2x}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({a}_{n}cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi n}{2}x)+{b}_{n}sin\\,(\\frac{\\pi n}{2}x))\n$$\n\nNow, we apply the initial condition $y(4)=3.$ Using the hint that the particular solution part evaluates to zero at $x=4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(4) & =A{e}^{-2(4)}+{y}_{p}(4) \\\\ 3 & =A{e}^{-8}+0 \\\\ A & =3{e}^{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $A$ back into the homogeneous part:\n\n$$\n{y}_{c}=(3{e}^{8}){e}^{-2x}=3{e}^{8-2x}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\ny(x)∼3{e}^{8-2x}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({a}_{n}cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi n}{2}x)+{b}_{n}sin\\,(\\frac{\\pi n}{2}x)).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "freeResponseTextbox-1",
          "tag": "mathquill",
          "choices": [],
